{"sourceUrl":"https://swywxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/82/c9879a242562/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.424931+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://swywxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/82/c9879a242562/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年招收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）章程》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>号）精神，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物学院将组织</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>开展</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年推免生（含直博生）预选拔工作，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><ol><li><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>招生专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span><span><strong>：</strong></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></li></ol><p><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物学院</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>接收硕士推免生专业目录：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>071000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100705</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>微生物与生化药学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（生物制药工程）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（抗体工程与细胞治疗）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（基因治疗与核酸药物）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药学（生物药物发现与转化）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物学院</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>接收</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>直博生</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>专业目录：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>071000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100705</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>微生物与生化药学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（一）推免生预选拔报名考生应符合以下基本条件：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、全国高校</span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类、经济学类、统计学类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>说明：未参加我校“</span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目但符合上述条件的本校学生，可以报名参加常规学制年限的推免生考核。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（二）学术学位直博推免生报考基本条件：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>申请学术学位直博生者，除满足上述报名条件（一）中的基本条件外，还应有较突出的专业素质，具有相应专业博士生培养潜质，学习成绩优异，并符合以下条件</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、条件</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中的一条且同时满足条件</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、国家级一流本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span><span><span>10%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span><span><span>10%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）；其他本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span><span><span>8%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span><span><span>8%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、国家理科基础科学研究和教学人才培养基地班（理科基地班）、国家生命科学与技术人才培养基地班（生科基地班）、国家基础学科拔尖学生培养计划（拔尖计划）专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、获得外语等级证书或成绩证明</span></span></span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩有效期在</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年之内</span></span></span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>六级（</span></span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span><span><span>450</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或托福（</span></span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span><span><span>90</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或雅思（</span></span></span><span><span>IELTS</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>或以第一作者（排位第一）在</span></span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>期刊（不含扩展版）上发表过一篇专业学术研究论文。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>按照中国药科大学国家基础药学拔尖培养计划</span></span></span><span><span>2.0</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>基地班的相关文件规定，该专业直博推免生推荐资格由孟目的学院及学校相关部门考核认定，暂不通过推免生预报名系统报考。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>特别说明：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、入选学校“</span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目且考核合格的学生，需报名参加我院的推免生预选拔及复试考核，复试合格且在全国推免服务系统中实际拟录取的考生方可进入我院“</span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通培养体系。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、学院内限填报</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、直博生申请人仅限填报</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>个直博生志愿，并应同时填报硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、申请程序</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>系统报名时间</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日。报名学生请在规定时间段内，登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>,</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>之后我部门会对报名学生进行资格审核，预计</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日前向符合条件、入围的学生在系统中发送通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知学生请在</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>点前</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>登陆系统确认</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>逾期未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、身份证及在读学生证（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、就读国家级一流本科专业、理科基地班、生科基地班、拔尖计划的专业证明（符合条件者必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、外语水平证明，如</span></span></span><span><span>CET-4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、个人简历：限</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>页，应包含科研经历及获奖情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、专家推荐书（暂不必填）：申请直博生者提供至少</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>份《专家推荐书》（可在预报名系统中生成下载模板），由所报考学科专业领域内的正高级教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）撰写的书面推荐意见（硕士推免生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求）；。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>报考硕士研究生的材料由学院进行资格审核。直博生的报考材料由研究生院统一进行资格审查。申请人在网上填报及向学院提交的各类信息、材料，必须真实准确。若发现申请材料有虚假成分，一经查实将取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>五、考核时间地点安排</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>本次考核均采用线下形式进行；预计</span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>-29</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日之间向预报名考生开展学科宣讲、专业面试考核、导师交流及实验室参观等活动，具体时间地点由各考核中心确定后通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>如有补充通知，将会在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>官方网站另行发布，请报名学生及时关注。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>六、食宿交通及相关保障</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>参加活动的学生来校参加考核期间的交通、食宿费用自理。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>七、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>025-8618</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5986</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>本实施方案的解释权归中国药科大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>中国药科大学生物药物学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e6cb820c39b10959127833bb47bb2272189bb614745c2dbf73f247d9d3bb750c","textLength":2260,"sourceSha256":"b35788a92fcd7efb5e6c11b96bea12e453c28eedc1b2f28f684f537e02552af3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a929f8c7d97d80152621","title":"2026年中国药科大学生物药物学院2027年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.424931+00:00"}
